data: {"id": "e03e6b6b46444c00-thinking-parallel_evidence-617", "run_id": "e03e6b6b46444c00", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-v03/workload` 当前 `phase=Pending`，`node=<none>`，`PodScheduled=False (Unschedulable)`，UID `88abe968-4c94-452f-b90d-943bd00c1500`。\n- **调度失败事件（直接原因）**：`default-scheduler` 发出 `FailedScheduling` 事件，原文为 **\"0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim 'unavailable-claim' not found.\"** 。\n- **Pod Spec 关键约束**：Pod 挂载了一个 `PersistentVolumeClaim`，`ClaimName: unavailable-claim`；无 Node-Selector、无特殊 Tolerations（仅有默认的 `not-ready` toleration）；资源请求极低（cpu 5m, memory 8Mi），不存在资源不足或", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788860730867, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

